# Ensemble Standards

Ensemble is a repository intelligence / code context engine.

## Runtime
- Python 3.14.x only (`>=3.14,<3.15`)
- VS Code extension Node: 26.3.0

## Scope
Keep Ensemble focused on:
- workspace discovery
- LSP and symbol intelligence
- disposable code graphs
- relevance ranking
- token-budgeted context assembly
- skill/instruction injection
- structured downstream hand-off

Do not add:
- model hosting
- model/provider routing
- autonomous agent loops
- MCP server orchestration
- durable memory
- provenance ledgers

## Safety
Workspace access stays scoped to `ENSEMBLE_WORKSPACE`.

## Changes
Keep diffs surgical and run `make test`.
